# konspekt content-addressed provenance stores.
#
# In the git binding, a stored file's git blob SHA IS its content hash
# (sources/README.md; spec/architecture/SERIALIZATION.md). The conformance
# checker re-hashes the working-tree bytes and compares. If git normalized line
# endings on checkout (core.autocrlf=true on Windows), a fresh checkout would
# re-hash to a different SHA and every provenance ref would fail to verify.
# Pin these stores to no EOL conversion so the blob SHA is stable on all platforms.
.konspekt/instance/sources/** -text
.konspekt/instance/commands/** -text
